### Cross-type private endpoints (ContentAdminApi)

### Hub summary — KPIs + rail counts
GET {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/private/content/summary?store={{STORE_ID}}&pod={{POD_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}
Cookie: SESSION={{SESSION_ID}}

### Snippets (legacy BOX rows): list, read, upsert, delete
GET {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/private/content/snippets?store={{STORE_ID}}&pod={{POD_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}
Cookie: SESSION={{SESSION_ID}}

###
GET {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/private/content/snippets/LANDING_PAGE?store={{STORE_ID}}&pod={{POD_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}
Cookie: SESSION={{SESSION_ID}}

###
PUT {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/private/content/snippets/LANDING_PAGE?store={{STORE_ID}}&pod={{POD_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: SESSION={{SESSION_ID}}

{
  "visible": true,
  "translations": [
    {"language": "en", "title": "Workplace supplies, delivered", "body": "<p>Everything your office needs.</p>", "metaDescription": "Acme Supply Co.", "keywords": "office supplies, b2b"}
  ]
}

###
DELETE {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/private/content/snippets/LANDING_PAGE?store={{STORE_ID}}&pod={{POD_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}
Cookie: SESSION={{SESSION_ID}}

### Redirects written by slug changes of published pages
GET {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/private/content/redirects?store={{STORE_ID}}&pod={{POD_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}
Cookie: SESSION={{SESSION_ID}}
